  "description": "Nalix.Network.Hosting provides Microsoft-style host and builder APIs for Nalix.Network. It wires packet registry discovery, packet dispatch, configuration application, and TCP listener lifecycle into a familiar builder/build/start workflow for quickly bootstrapping Nalix-based servers.",
  "iconFile": "nalix.png",
